{
  "name": "Helve — Audio & Podcast Transcription Brief (Self-Hosted)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Audio & Podcast Transcription Brief\nTranscribes an audio/video URL with speaker diarization (`helve.audio_transcribe`) and summarizes the transcript via `openrouter.chat` through 1 `HELVE_API_KEY` at 0% markup.\n\nNo separate AssemblyAI, Deepgram, or OpenRouter accounts required.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "sticky-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "trigger-2",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        200,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "audio_url",
              "name": "audio_url",
              "value": "https://example.com/sample-recording.mp3",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "set-audio-2",
      "name": "Set Audio URL",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        420,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "audio",
        "operation": "audioTranscribe",
        "audioUrl": "={{ $json.audio_url }}",
        "audioProvider": "auto",
        "audioOptions": {
          "diarize": true,
          "timestamps": "word",
          "waitForCompletion": true,
          "pollTimeoutSeconds": 300
        },
        "spendLimitUsd": 0.5
      },
      "id": "helve-audio-2",
      "name": "Helve: Audio Transcribe",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-helve.helve",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        680,
        380
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "helveApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Helve API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "tool",
        "operation": "callTool",
        "toolId": "openrouter.chat",
        "argumentsJson": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'openai/gpt-4o-mini', messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'Summarize key decisions and action items from this transcript:\\n\\n' + ($json.result?.text || $json.text || JSON.stringify($json)).slice(0, 12000) }] }) }}",
        "spendLimitUsd": 0.1
      },
      "id": "helve-summary-2",
      "name": "Helve: Summarize Transcript",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-helve.helve",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        960,
        380
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "helveApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Helve API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Pipeline Stages\n1. **Set Audio URL**: Paste any public MP3/WAV/M4A link in **Set Audio URL**.\n2. **Transcribe & Summarize**: **Helve: Audio Transcribe** runs speaker-diarized transcription (polling `/v1/jobs/{id}` automatically) and **Helve: Summarize Transcript** produces executive summary + action items via `openrouter.chat`.\n\n*Requires self-hosted n8n with `n8n-nodes-helve@0.1.0`.*",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-stages-2",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Pipeline Stages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        420
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Manual Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set Audio URL",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set Audio URL": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Helve: Audio Transcribe",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Helve: Audio Transcribe": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Helve: Summarize Transcript",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
